    "**Claims data:** Claims are stored in an on-premises claims system. Contoso's integration team exposes it through a Contoso-hosted **MCP server** with three tools: `get_claim` (read a claim), `list_documents` (list documents a customer has uploaded, including their extracted text), and `issue_payout` (create a payment instruction).",
